  "fullContentHtml": "\n                    <div class=\"entry-image image-hover-effect hover-effect-shine\">\n                <div class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n                    <img width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1.jpg 1200w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-1-150x84.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\">                </div><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"entry-details\">\n        <!-- .entry-header -->\n\n        <div class=\"entry-content\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"heading-share\" id=\"shareBtnWrap\" style=\"margin:12px 0;display:none;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;\">\n\n  <!-- SHARE BUTTON -->\n  <button type=\"button\" id=\"nativeShareBtn\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;border:1.5px solid #2563eb;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:inherit;\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n      <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n      <line x1=\"8.59\" y1=\"13.51\" x2=\"15.42\" y2=\"17.49\"></line>\n      <line x1=\"15.41\" y1=\"6.51\" x2=\"8.59\" y2=\"10.49\"></line>\n    </svg>\n    Share\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- DOWNLOAD AS PDF BUTTON -->\n  <button type=\"button\" id=\"pdfDownloadBtn\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#16a34a;border:1.5px solid #16a34a;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:inherit;\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path>\n      <polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline>\n      <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line>\n    </svg>\n    Download As PDF\n  </button>\n\n</div>\n\n<p>The <strong>Railway Recruitment Board has declared the RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 on 21st November for all candidates who appeared in the CBT-1 examination</strong>. The RRB NTPC CBT 1 Exam was conducted from 7th August to 9th September across multiple exam centers. Along with the RRB NTPC Undergraduate Result 2025, the NTPC Cut Off list has also been released for all categories. Candidates can now scroll through the detailed article to get the RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 link, cut-off details, and next stage selection process.</p><div class=\"code-block code-block-12\" style=\"margin: 8px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://testbook.com/pdf-viewer?u=https:%2F%2Fcdn.testbook.com/1776262755712-Current%20Affairs.pdf/1776262757.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Free Railway Exam Current Affairs Booklet 2026 PDF: Click to Download</a></strong></p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 Out</h2>\n<p>A total of <strong>52,008 candidates have qualified the RRB NTPC UG CBT 1 Exam 2025</strong>. This year, over 63 lakh candidates appeared for the 3445 RRB NTPC undergraduate-level posts across India. Based on the performance in this exam, successful candidates have been provisionally shortlisted for the 2nd Stage CBT. The posts under this recruitment include Commercial cum Ticket Clerk, Junior Clerk cum Typist, Accounts Clerk cum Typist, and Train Clerk. The next shortlisting for Document Verification will depend on the scores of candidates in the 2nd Stage CBT, and for some posts, the combined performance of 2nd Stage CBT and CBTST will be considered. The schedule for the 2nd Stage CBT for NTPC Undergraduate posts will be announced soon.</p><div class=\"code-block code-block-9\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n<div style=\"\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:16px;\n  background:#fff9f4;\n  border:1px solid #f3c9b8;\n  border-radius:16px;\n  padding:16px 20px;\n  margin:22px 0;\n  flex-wrap:wrap;\n\">\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex:1;\">\n    <img src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Google.webp\" alt=\"Google\" style=\"width:32px; height:auto;\">\n\n    <div style=\"line-height:1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#111;\">\n        Add Testbook as Preferred Source on Google\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=testbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"\n      background:#ea4335;\n      color:#fff;\n      padding:10px 22px;\n      border-radius:22px;\n      font-size:15px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      text-decoration:none;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    \">\n    Add Preference\n  </a>\n\n</div></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a style=\"background-color: red; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://forms.gle/rZLCqZAWUjzxVwQ16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Share Your RRB NTPC UG Result 2025</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a style=\"background-color: red; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://testbook.com/news/rrb-ntpc-ug-cut-off-2025-out/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"tb-auto-button\"><strong>RRB NTPC UG Cut Off Marks 2025 Out: Click to Download</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a style=\"background-color: red; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://testbook.com/news/rrb-ntpc-undergraduate-scorecard-2025-out/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"tb-auto-button\"><strong>RRB NTPC UG Scorecard 2025 Link Active: Click to Download</strong></a></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-7\" style=\"margin: 8px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;\">\n\n</div>\n\n<h2>RRB NTPC Undergraduate Result 2025 (CEN 06/2024)</h2>\n<p>Through the <a href=\"https://testbook.com/rrb-ntpc\">RRB NTPC UG Recruitment 2025</a>, the Railway Recruitment Boards will fill a total of 3445 vacancies across India. Candidates who appeared for the CBT 1 exam can check their roll numbers in the region-wise result PDFs on official RRB websites. Below is the detailed table of RRB NTPC CBT 1 UG Result 2025.</p>\n<table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><strong>RRB NTPC UG Result 2025</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Organisation</td>\n<td>Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exam Name</td>\n<td>RRB NTPC CBT 1 Exam 2025</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Post Name</td>\n<td>Undergraduate-Level</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total Vacancies</td>\n<td>3,445</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://testbook.com/rrb-ntpc/result\"><strong>RRB NTPC UG CBT 1 Result 2025</strong></a></td>\n<td><strong>21st November</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://testbook.com/news/rrb-ntpc-undergraduate-scorecard-2025-out/\"><strong>RRB NTPC Score Card 2025</strong></a></td>\n<td><strong>21st November</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Railway NTPC CBT 1 Exam Date</td>\n<td>7th August to 9th September 2025</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Candidates Appeared</td>\n<td>63,26,818</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Candidates Qualified</td>\n<td>52,008</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRB NTPC CBT 2 Exam Date 2025</td>\n<td>December 2025</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selection Process</td>\n<td>CBT 1 → CBT 2 → Skill Test (CBAT) → Document Verification → Medical Test</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Official Website</td>\n<td>www.rrbcdg.gov.in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariupdatesbytestbook/133\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Check RRB NTPC UG Sample Scorecard&nbsp;</a></p>\n<h2>RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 Download Link Active</h2>\n<p>The RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 link has been officially activated on 21st November at all regional RRB websites. Candidates can log in using their registration number and date of birth to view their scorecard and qualifying status. With the link now live, accessing the result, cut-off details, and merit list has become quick and convenient. Candidates are advised to download and save their scorecard immediately for future stages of the selection process. The direct link to download the RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 PDF shared below.</p>\n<p>Check <a href=\"https://testbook.com/rrb-ntpc/salary\">RRB NTPC Salary</a></p>\n<h2>RRB NTPC UG Result 2025 Merit List PDF Download [Zone Wise]</h2>\n<p>The RRB NTPC Undergraduate Result 2025 has been published in PDF format on the official regional websites of the Railway Recruitment Board. The RRB NTPC UG exam is conducted across multiple regions in India, including RRB Ahmedabad, Ajmer, Allahabad (Prayagraj), Bangalore, Bhopal, Bhubaneswar, Bilaspur, Chandigarh, Chennai, Gorakhpur, Guwahati, Jammu–Srinagar, Kolkata, Malda, Mumbai, Muzaffarpur, Patna, Ranchi, Secunderabad, Siliguri, and Thiruvananthapuram.We have attached the results of all 21 zones separately in the table given below which provides region-wise links for easy access to the result. Bookmark this page to stay updated.</p>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table\" style=\"width: 64.4532%; height: 887px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #c1d9e9;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\" colspan=\"4\"><strong>RRB NTPC CBT 1 Result 2025 Zone Wise PDF Download</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><strong>Railway NTPC Zone</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><strong>Download Link</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><strong>Candidates Selected</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><strong>Vacancies</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-ahmedabad\">RRB Ahmedabad</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1763782680113-RRB-AHEMDABAD-RESULT.pdf/1763782681.pdf\">Click Here</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">3155</td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">210</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-ajmer\">RRB Ajmer</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1763722998055-RRB%20Ajmer%20NTPC%20UG%20Merit%20List%202025%20PDF.pdf/1763723000.pdf\">Click Here</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">1066</td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-bengaluru\">RRB Bengaluru</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1763721664797-RRB%20NTPC%20Bengaluru.pdf/1763721665.pdf\">Click Here</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">&nbsp;902</td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-bhopal\">RRB Bhopal</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1763726315044-RRB%20B