<td style=\"height: 37px;\">89</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-siliguri\">RRB Siliguri</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1780388982490-RRB%20NTPC%20CBT%201%20Siliguri.pdf/1780388994.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">630</td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://testbook.com/railway-jobs/rrb-thiruvananthapuram\">RRB Thiruvananthapuram</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1763716758548-RRB%20NTPC%20UG%20Thiruvananthapuram%20Merit%20List%202025%20PDF.pdf/1763716760.pdf\">Click Here</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">1681</td>\n<td style=\"height: 37px;\">112</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total </strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 36px;\"><strong>52,008</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 36px;\"><strong>3445</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><em>Note: All the Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) NTPC Result 2025 has been announced for all the regions. Bookmark on this page for all the updates.&nbsp;</em></p>\n</div>\n<h2>How to Check RRB NTPC UG Result 2025?</h2>\n<p>Candidates who appeared for the RRB NTPC Undergraduate (UG) CBT 1 Exam can follow these simple steps to check and download their results. Ensure you have your Roll Number ready for quick verification.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Visit the official website of the RRB region you applied for (links mentioned above).</li>\n<li>Click on the link provided for RRB NTPC Undergraduate Result 2025.</li>\n<li>Select your respective RRB Region.</li>\n<li>The RRB NTPC CBT 1 UG Result 2025 PDF will appear on the screen.</li>\n<li>Press Ctrl + F and enter your Roll Number to check your qualification status</li>\n<li>If your Roll Number is listed, you have qualified for the CBT 2 Exam.</li>\n<li>Download and save the PDF for future reference.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>RRB NTPC UG Cut Off 2025 Marks</h2>\n<p>The RRB NTPC UG Cut Off 2025 marks will be released zone-wise and category-wise along with the result and merit list. These cut-off scores are determined based on factors such as the difficulty level of the CBT 1 exam, total number of candidates appearing, and the number of vacancies available for 12th-level NTPC posts. Check the below section for region wise RRB NTPC UG Cut Off 2025 Marks.</p>\n<h3>RRB Ahemdabad NTPC UG Cut Off 2025</h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-56361 size-large\" src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024-1024x393.jpg\" alt=\"RRB NTPC UG CBT 1 Ahmedabad Cut Off 2024\" width=\"640\" height=\"246\" srcset=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024-1024x393.jpg 1024w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024-300x115.jpg 300w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024-768x294.jpg 768w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024-150x57.jpg 150w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-NTPC-UG-CBT-1-Ahmedabad-Cut-Off-2024.jpg 1127w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\"></p>\n<h3>RRB Mumbai NTPC UG Cut Off 2025</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-13085 size-full\" src=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-Mumbai-NTPC-Cut-Off-2025.jpg\" alt=\"RRB Mumbai NTPC Cut Off 2025\" width=\"877\" height=\"337\" srcset=\"https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-Mumbai-NTPC-Cut-Off-2025.jpg 877w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/RRB-Mumbai-NTPC-Cut-Off-2025-300x115.jpg 300w, https://testbook.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2025/